ları yaratıcılık ve niyetle yükselten özel çözümler yaratıyoruz.\" image_1=\"pages/img-117.webp\" style_image_1=\"pages/img-117.webp\" title_2=\"Deneyim ve Yenilik\" description_2=\"On yıllık yaratıcı deneyimle desteklenen, markaları büyütmek, izleyicilere ilham vermek ve anlamlı etki yaratmak için strateji, tasarım ve teknolojiyi bir araya getiren görsel deneyimler üretiyoruz.\" image_2=\"pages/img-118.webp\" style_image_2=\"pages/img-118.webp\"][/about-us-information]\n[site-statistics style=\"2\" quantity=\"3\" title_1=\"<br> dijital stratejisi sayesinde elde edilen gelir\" data_1=\"28\" unit_1=\"M+\" title_2=\"Nitelikli potansiyel müşteriler <br> oluşturuldu\" data_2=\"64\" unit_2=\"K+\" title_3=\"Markalar Orisa ile <br>\'i ölçeklendirdi\" data_3=\"190\" unit_3=\"+\"][/site-statistics]\n[our-journey subtitle=\"Biz Kimiz\" title=\"Yolculuğumuz\" description=\"Fikirlerin, büyümenin ve anlamlı etkinin zaman çizelgesi. Basit bir fikirden önemli dijital deneyimleri şekillendirmeye kadar.\" primary_action_label=\"Bir Proje Başlatın\" primary_action_url=\"/contact-1\" card_image=\"pages/img-121.webp\" card_badge=\"Since 2012\" card_title=\"Artificial intelligence and Big Data expert\" card_description=\"We always provide people a complete solution upon focused of any business\" card_label=\"Orisa Nova&lt;sup&gt;&amp;reg;&lt;/sup&gt;\" card_url=\"/portfolio-1\" items_quantity=\"4\" items_date_1=\"2021 &mdash; Expanding Capabilities\" items_title_1=\"Tasarım Stüdyosundan Dijital Ajansa\" items_company_1=\"\" items_description_1=\"As demand grew, so did our expertise. We expanded into UI/UX, web development, and digital strategy &mdash; building cross-functional teams to deliver end-to-end solutions.\" items_url_1=\"#\" items_date_2=\"2022 &mdash; Trusted by Growing Brands\" items_title_2=\"ML Infrastructure Engineer\" items_company_2=\"Uzun Vadeli Ortaklıklar Kurmak\" items_description_2=\"We began working with scaling businesses and established brands, focusing on long-term collaboration instead of one-off projects. Our process matured, and our impact became measurable.\" items_url_2=\"#\" items_date_3=\"2024 &mdash; Designing for the Future\" items_title_3=\"İnovasyon, Ölçek ve Sırada Ne Var?\" items_company_3=\"\" items_description_3=\"Today, we continue to evolve &mdash; embracing new technologies, smarter workflows, and future-ready design systems. Our journey is ongoing, and we\'re just getting started.\" items_url_3=\"#\" items_date_4=\"2025+ &mdash; Beyond Boundaries\" items_title_4=\"Sonraki Bölüm\" items_company_4=\"\" items_description_4=\"With a global mindset and a passion for innovation, we\'re shaping what\'s next in digital experiences &mdash; together with ambitious partners around the world.\" items_url_4=\"#\"][/our-journey]\n[awards title=\"Ödüller.\" action_label=\"Tüm Ödülleri Görüntüle\" action_url=\"/portfolio-1\" quantity=\"5\" date_1=\"19 Oct 2024\" title_1=\"En İyi Web Tasarım Ajansı\" organization_1=\"Web Excellence Awards\" url_1=\"https://csswinner.com\" url_label_1=\"csswinner.com\" image_1=\"pages/img-40.webp\" image_lg_1=\"pages/img-40-lg.webp\" date_2=\"12 Feb 2026\" title_2=\"Yılın Dijital Ajansı\" organization_2=\"Global Digital Excellence Awards\" url_2=\"https://globaldigitalawards.com\" url_label_2=\"globaldigitalawards.com\" image_2=\"pages/img-41.webp\" image_lg_2=\"pages/img-41-lg.webp\" date_3=\"08 Aug 2025\" title_3=\"Dijital Deneyimde Yenilik\" organization_3=\"International Digital Awards\" url_3=\"https://digital-awards.org\" url_label_3=\"digital-awards.org\" image_3=\"pages/img-42.webp\" image_lg_3=\"pages/img-42-lg.webp\" date_4=\"19 Oct 2024\" title_4=\"En İyi Entegre Dijital Kampanya\" organization_4=\"Drum Awards\" url_4=\"https://thedrum.com\" url_label_4=\"thedrum.com\" image_4=\"pages/img-43.webp\" image_lg_4=\"pages/img-43-lg.webp\" date_5=\"03 Apr 2026\" title_5=\"Büyüme Odaklı Dijital Ajans\" organization_5=\"Clutch Leaders Awards\" url_5=\"https://clutch.co\" url_label_5=\